 nity!\nAt our last gathering\, we welcomed three new members who each inoc
 ulated and took home a bag of Oyster mushroom grain spawn.\nThey’ll be b
 ringing their grain bags back\, and we’ll demonstrate the next stage of 
 cultivation by transferring fully colonized grain spawn into Master’s Mi
 x\, a hardwood and soybean hull substrate.\nWhether you’re an experience
 d grower\, a complete beginner or just curious about the fascinating world
  of fungi\, there’s something for everyone.\n🍄 Hands-on mushroom cult
 ivation\n🍄 Learn about grain spawn and substrate\n🍄 Free beginner mu
 shroom grow kits\, one per new growing family\n🍄 Connect with fellow mu
 shroom enthusiasts\nNo experience necessary. Growing is optional\, and fam
 ilies are always welcome.\n😋 Coming hungry? There’s also a food truck
  at the location that a couple of our members have tried and recommend\, i
 f it’s open that evening.\n📅 Wednesday\, December 2\n⏰ 4:30–7:30 
